{
  "description": "#40 d34: ends a PR's fixer story on a trusted /stop or thumbs-down, with the built-in queue.stop: records the stop on the PR's key, removes its queued request and retries, revokes a dispatch no run claimed yet, cancels its running fixer runs (no push, no hand-back) and ends the story's status comment ('stopped by @user'). Two minutes later a sweep cancels a run of the story that started just after (a chain's next stage). Non-agentic: no actor, no agent.",
